<view class="page cart"><brand-header back="{{true}}" title="购物车"></brand-header><view class="pad"><view class="top-title">购物车<text class="cart-count">{{items.length}} 件项目</text></view><view class="sub-title">为每一次美丽，认真选择</view><view wx:if="{{items.length}}" class="cart-list"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="cart-card"><button class="select-circle {{item.selected ? 'checked' : ''}}" bindtap="toggle" data-id="{{item.id}}" aria-label="选择项目"><ui-icon wx:if="{{item.selected}}" name="check" active="{{true}}" size="28"></ui-icon></button><button class="cart-image" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openProduct"><media-placeholder src="{{item.image}}" label="项目图片" fit="aspectFit" blank="{{true}}" kind="product"></media-placeholder></button><view class="cart-product"><view class="between"><button class="cart-name" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openProduct">{{item.name}}</button><button class="remove-item" bindtap="remove" data-id="{{item.id}}" aria-label="移除项目"><ui-icon name="close" size="25"></ui-icon></button></view><view class="card-note">{{item.desc}}</view><view class="between cart-price-line"><text class="price"><text wx:for="{{item.priceParts}}" wx:for-item="part" wx:key="*this" class="{{part === '¥' || part === '积分' || part === '+' ? 'product-price-unit' : ''}}">{{part}}</text></text><view class="quantity"><button data-id="{{item.id}}" data-delta="-1" bindtap="changeQuantity" disabled="{{item.quantity === 1}}" aria-label="减少数量"><ui-icon name="minus" size="22"></ui-icon></button><text>{{item.quantity}}</text><button data-id="{{item.id}}" data-delta="1" bindtap="changeQuantity" disabled="{{item.quantity === 99}}" aria-label="增加数量"><ui-icon name="plus" size="22"></ui-icon></button></view></view></view></view></view><view wx:else class="empty cart-empty"><view class="empty-icon"><ui-icon name="cart" size="80"></ui-icon></view><view class="empty-title">购物车还是空的</view><view class="stacked-action"><button class="primary-button" bindtap="goCategory">去逛逛</button><text>去挑选适合自己的美丽项目吧</text></view></view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{items.length}}">价格为示例展示。实际项目及适用性以专业面诊评估为准。</view></view><view class="cart-checkout" wx:if="{{items.length}}"><button class="row all-select" bindtap="toggleAll"><view class="select-circle {{allSelected ? 'checked' : ''}}"><ui-icon wx:if="{{allSelected}}" name="check" active="{{true}}" size="28"></ui-icon></view><text>全选</text></button><view class="cart-total"><view class="small muted">合计</view><text class="price"><text wx:for="{{totalParts}}" wx:for-item="part" wx:key="*this" class="{{part === '¥' || part === '积分' || part === '+' ? 'product-price-unit' : ''}}">{{part}}</text></text></view><button class="primary-button" bindtap="checkout" disabled="{{!selectedCount || submitting}}">结算（{{selectedCount}}）</button></view></view>
